1
00:00:09,214 --> 00:00:11,069
[Subtitles by that bilge rat danielsangeo]

2
00:00:12,737 --> 00:00:17,675
Arr, these caverns be no place for
a gentleman of fortune such as meself.

3
00:00:18,309 --> 00:00:21,112
I sees no more agitators in the forward,

4
00:00:21,112 --> 00:00:24,282
I best be plottin' a new
course for the topside.

5
00:00:24,282 --> 00:00:27,051
Me mechanical longboat
been servin' me true.

6
00:00:27,051 --> 00:00:30,188
I hope the musket fire changed
your inclination none.

7
00:00:31,022 --> 00:00:32,590
What be here?

8
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:36,227
Arr, down's not the way I be seekin'.

9
00:00:36,227 --> 00:00:41,065
I already done spend enough time
below deck to last me two lives over.

10
00:00:41,065 --> 00:00:43,067
Well, enough hemmin' and hawin',

11
00:00:43,067 --> 00:00:45,903
it be high time I aweighed
anchor and shoved off.

12
00:00:49,073 --> 00:00:51,442
'Tis true of the--what be that noise?

13
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:55,346
Arr, these caves be haunted, says I.

14
00:00:55,346 --> 00:00:59,550
But, livin' and dead alike shall bow
before the great Cap'n Freeman.

15
00:01:00,351 --> 00:01:01,319
Avast!

16
00:01:01,319 --> 00:01:02,887
Gunner off the starboard bow!

17
00:01:05,156 --> 00:01:06,958
Arr har har har!

18
00:01:06,958 --> 00:01:10,361
I deadlights captured thee afore
ye could repel boarders.

19
00:01:10,895 --> 00:01:14,265
Didn't care for the taste of me
repeatin' flintlock, did ye now?

20
00:01:14,565 --> 00:01:17,735
Well, blow me down for an old sea calf.

21
00:01:17,735 --> 00:01:20,371
'tis a beauty of a cannon, that there is.

22
00:01:20,371 --> 00:01:25,109
I'll be mountin' that on me vessel once
I's done explorin' this fort's armory.

23
00:01:25,109 --> 00:01:29,180
Arr, I could surely go for a
bottle of rum right now.

24
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:30,381
Ahoy there!

25
00:01:30,381 --> 00:01:31,182
HECU: Movement!

26
00:01:33,184 --> 00:01:34,919
You lunkheaded milksops!

27
00:01:34,919 --> 00:01:37,388
Don't you know who you're
quarrelin' with?!

28
00:01:37,388 --> 00:01:39,667
I be the great pirate Freeman!

29
00:01:39,667 --> 00:01:40,458
[machine gun fire]

30
00:01:40,458 --> 00:01:43,861
Arr, that way be soundin'
a mite dangerous-like.

31
00:01:43,861 --> 00:01:45,830
Perchance I be goin' this way.

32
00:01:47,198 --> 00:01:47,732
Sink me.

33
00:01:50,034 --> 00:01:51,769
Well, ain't you the sly one?

34
00:01:51,769 --> 00:01:53,504
Gettin' the drop on ol' Freeman.

35
00:01:53,871 --> 00:01:56,741
'Tis of no matter; I'll lays all athwart.

36
00:01:57,041 --> 00:02:01,179
I sees there be no treaty to be
made what with the likes of thee.

37
00:02:01,746 --> 00:02:06,050
If it's a fair fight you're lookin' for,
then you've come to the wrong man.

38
00:02:06,050 --> 00:02:10,588
Yarr, the battle be ragin' outside,
making now the perfect time to plunder.

39
00:02:12,890 --> 00:02:16,427
Devil burn me!  These stores be
filled with empty boxes!

40
00:02:16,427 --> 00:02:19,430
What manner of trickery be behind this?

41
00:02:19,430 --> 00:02:21,999
Arr, enough of these monkeyshines.

42
00:02:21,999 --> 00:02:26,237
It's time I be handin' out a
lesson in humility to these swabs.

43
00:02:26,237 --> 00:02:29,273
I'll load up me miniature
grapeshot for the task.

44
00:02:29,273 --> 00:02:32,777
One blast of this and they'll be wishin'
they were in a different line of work.

45
00:02:34,078 --> 00:02:35,847
Come back, you cowardly cur!

46
00:02:36,914 --> 00:02:39,550
Arr, the bloodlettin' be flowin' over.

47
00:02:39,984 --> 00:02:43,120
I shows no quarter to
lubbers such as thee.

48
00:02:43,521 --> 00:02:47,525
You call yourselves Marines, but
mariners I says you're not.

49
00:02:47,525 --> 00:02:49,794
I bet none of ye could
rig a bunt gasket

50
00:02:49,794 --> 00:02:53,531
'round a master jigger if your lives
were hangin' in the balance.

51
00:02:53,531 --> 00:02:55,566
Arr.

52
00:02:55,566 --> 00:03:00,271
But I do thank ye for all the munitions
ye swabs been providin' me with.

53
00:03:00,271 --> 00:03:02,673
It be a shame for them to go to waste

54
00:03:02,673 --> 00:03:05,009
what with so many of
thee left to cut down.

55
00:03:06,110 --> 00:03:07,211
Fire the cannon!

56
00:03:08,579 --> 00:03:11,015
Arr har har har har har!

57
00:03:12,216 --> 00:03:15,186
Them that dies be the lucky ones!

58
00:03:15,186 --> 00:03:18,923
And there be plenty o'
luck goin' round today!

59
00:03:18,923 --> 00:03:20,424
A-har-har-har-har....

60
00:03:21,926 --> 00:03:23,694
By thunder, what be this?

61
00:03:25,696 --> 00:03:26,297
I knows--

62
00:03:27,198 --> 00:03:30,401
Arr, I knows not what be
transgressin' here,

63
00:03:30,401 --> 00:03:34,305
but in my sight, you're all not
better than a bunch of fightin' cocks.

64
00:03:34,305 --> 00:03:36,507
Now, what do we have here?

65
00:03:36,507 --> 00:03:38,376
An anti-scurvy machine.

66
00:03:39,343 --> 00:03:40,645
Shiver me timbers!

67
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:45,983
By the powers!  There be all manner
of queer beasties in this hold.

68
00:03:45,983 --> 00:03:48,152
I cares not for 'em.

69
00:03:48,152 --> 00:03:52,990
Now, what booty be so special
here if it weren't guarded, I asks.

70
00:03:54,158 --> 00:03:55,960
I aims to find out.

71
00:03:57,595 --> 00:03:58,729
Arr, this must be the brig.

72
00:03:58,729 --> 00:03:59,063
GUARD: Hello.
Arr, this must be the brig.

73
00:03:59,063 --> 00:03:59,864
Arr, this must be the brig.

74
00:03:59,864 --> 00:04:01,699
You stinkin' bilge rat!

75
00:04:03,701 --> 00:04:08,272
I swears, the men behind this
mess will all swing for sure.

76
00:04:09,507 --> 00:04:11,175
Ho there, squire!

77
00:04:11,175 --> 00:04:13,344
What say ye to joinin' me crew?

78
00:04:13,344 --> 00:04:17,081
I gives you me affidavi', I'll give
you a cut of any loot we take.

79
00:04:17,081 --> 00:04:18,549
GUARD: Okay, why not?

80
00:04:18,549 --> 00:04:18,749
Yarr--
GUARD: Didn't want to die alone anyway.

81
00:04:18,749 --> 00:04:19,917
GUARD: Didn't want to die alone anyway.

82
00:04:19,917 --> 00:04:22,653
Yarr!  That be the spirit!

83
00:04:22,653 --> 00:04:26,357
Let us charge forth and paint
the walls red with blood!

84
00:04:26,357 --> 00:04:28,092
GUARD: I don't know if we should
go any further.

85
00:04:28,092 --> 00:04:29,360
GUARD: Th-this doesn't look right.

86
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:31,562
Quakin' in your booties, now are ye?

87
00:04:31,562 --> 00:04:33,564
Ye yellow-bellied sapsucker!

88
00:04:33,564 --> 00:04:34,799
Just follow me!

89
00:04:36,033 --> 00:04:37,435
Arr, get down!

90
00:04:37,935 --> 00:04:39,236
Get down, I says!

91
00:04:40,104 --> 00:04:43,374
You blunderin' squid!
What good are ye now?

92
00:04:43,374 --> 00:04:45,843
A fine mate you turned out to be!

93
00:04:45,843 --> 00:04:46,911
Curse it all!

94
00:04:48,479 --> 00:04:49,647
Arr...

95
00:04:51,315 --> 00:04:54,118
That jack be right handy at his post.

96
00:04:54,118 --> 00:04:56,287
Unlike some I could name.

97
00:04:56,287 --> 00:04:59,023
Arr, I best be awaitin' this one out.

98
00:05:01,225 --> 00:05:04,601
I wasn't goin' to give that
swab any of the loot anyhow.

